  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Moldova &#x2013; Seed multiplication</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a loan from DGGF, De Bolster Beheer B.V. will be enabled to realize its business investment plans and to expand the impact in Moldova.De Bolster started up in Moldova in 2013 with its own production of organic seeds, but also with the collaboration with small producers. To improve productivity and quality, the company wants to invest further in a storage shed, processing machines and training of staff and producers.</narrative>
  </description>
